	<div class="row">
	
	<div class="col-md-12 col-sm-12">
	
	<div class="row">
	<div class="col-md-3">
		
	</div>
	<div class="col-md-6">
		<img src="images/prestige/new-launch-projects-in-bangalore.webp" alt="Featured Image of New Launch Projects In Bangalore" title="New Launch Projects In Bangalore" style="width:100%;" >
	</div>
	<div class="col-md-3">
		
	</div>
	</div>

	<p>
	New Launch projects in Bangalore are premium housing townships that are located in prime areas like Whitefield, Yelahanka, etc. These newly launched projects are recently launched or are awaiting to be launched in 2024. These townships comprise villas, apartments, and plotted developments with many amenities. The projects are offered at a reasonable price structure with offers and discounts. Buyers can book their dream property during this phase to get many deals.
	</p>
	
	<p>
	Some of the best new launch projects in Bangalore 2024 are:
	</p>
	
	
	<label><strong>1. Prestige Raintree Park -</strong></label>
	
	<div class="row">
	<div class="col-md-3">
		
	</div>
	<div class="col-md-6">
		<img src="images/prestige/prestige-raintree-park.webp" alt="Featured Image of Prestige Raintree Park" title="Prestige Raintree Park" style="width:100%;" >
	</div>
	<div class="col-md-3">
		
	</div>
	</div>
	
	<p>
	Prestige Raintree Park is a 107-acre grand residential township that also features a commercial space of 25 acre. It is located in Whitefield near Varthur Rd and is coming up in 3 phases. Its residential area covers 82 acres, and the commercial space consists of a tech park and a mall. Phase 1 is spread over 28 acres and hosts 18 towers that house 1600 well-crafted apartments. These apartments are presented in 3, 3.5, and 4.5 BHK sizes with a floor area of 2005 sq. ft. to 3700 sq. ft. Its price is set for Rs 2.9 Cr and will be launched soon. 
	</p>
	
	
	<label><strong>2. Prestige Park Ridge</strong></label>
	
	<div class="row">
	<div class="col-md-3">
		
	</div>
	<div class="col-md-6">
		<img src="images/prestige/prestige-park-ridge.webp" alt="Featured Image of Prestige Park Ridge" title="Prestige Park Ridge" style="width:100%;" >
	</div>
	<div class="col-md-3">
		
	</div>
	</div>
	
	<p>
	Prestige Park Ridge is a classic residential enclave launched by Prestige Group on Bannerghatta Road. The township is a marvelous project spread over 26.2 acres and houses 1200 apartments. These units come in sizes 2, 3, and 4 BHK. The site boasts 12 high-rise towers with fast-working lifts and other features. The units' price begins at Rs 65 Lakhs onwards. It is scheduled for launch in Dec 2024 and will be completed in 4 years of construction time.
	</p>
	
	
	<label><strong>3. Prestige Pine Forest</strong></label>

	<div class="row">
	<div class="col-md-3">
		
	</div>
	<div class="col-md-6">
		<img src="images/prestige/prestige-pine-forest.webp" alt="Featured Image of Prestige Pine Forest" title="Prestige Pine Forest" style="width:100%;" >
	</div>
	<div class="col-md-3">
		
	</div>
	</div>

	<p>
	Prestige Pine Forest, located in Whitefield, is a lavish residential venture sprawled over 10 acres. It is a Prestige Group project that offers 230 premium units of 2, 3, and 4 BHK sizes. The SBA of the flats ranges between 2000 sq. ft. and 4000 sq. ft. The units are spacious and offered at Rs 1.8 Cr onwards. The site has applied for RERA approval and is set to launch in July 2024. It will be delivered to the buyers in Dec 2028, after 4 years.
	</p>
	
	<label><strong>4. Prestige Falcon City Luxe</strong></label>

	<div class="row">
	<div class="col-md-3">
		
	</div>
	<div class="col-md-6">
		<img src="images/prestige/prestige-falcon-city-luxe.webp" alt="Featured Image of Prestige Falcon City Luxe" title="Prestige Falcon City Luxe" style="width:100%;" >
	</div>
	<div class="col-md-3">
		
	</div>
	</div>

	<p>
	Prestige Falcon City Luxe is a highly anticipated apartment project by Prestige Group on Kanakpura Rd. It offers luxurious 3 and 4-BHK apartments on 33 acres of prime land. There are 2100 spacious apartments, with 3 BHK units of 1800 sq. ft. and 4 BHK of 2700 sq. ft. Residents can enjoy large, comfortable living spaces that provide luxury and elegance. It is all set to launch in 2024 and will be completed in 4 years of time.
	</p>
	
	
	<label><strong>5. Prestige Eaton Park @ The Prestige City Bangalore</strong></label>

	<div class="row">
	<div class="col-md-3">
		
	</div>
	<div class="col-md-6">
		<img src="images/prestige/prestige-eaton-park-at-the-prestige-city-bangalore.webp" alt="Featured Image of Prestige Eaton Park @ The Prestige City Bangalore" title="Prestige Eaton Park @ The Prestige City Bangalore" style="width:100%;" >
	</div>
	<div class="col-md-3">
		
	</div>
	</div>

	<p>
	Prestige Eaton Park is a modern residential project by <a href="https://www.prestigesouthernstar.info/prestige-group.html" title="Prestige Group"><b>Prestige Group</b></a> on Sarjapur Road, East <a href="https://www.prestigesouthernstar.info/bangalore.html" title="Bangalore"><b>Bangalore</b></a>. It features a large tower in Prestige City, offering 1, 2, and 3 BHK flats. The project promises a luxurious living experience with its modern design and world-class amenities. It will be inaugurated in Dec 2023, with possession by 2027. The cost of the flats starts at Rs. 75 lakhs and goes upto Rs. 1.8 Cr.
	</p>
	
	
	<p>
	Prestige Group pre launch new project is <a href="https://www.prestigesouthernstar.info/" title="Prestige Southern Star"><b>Prestige Southern Star</b></a>
	</p>
	
	
	</div>
	
		
				
	
	
      
